            "text": "They are white and fluffy."
          },
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "They don’t make rain."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "order": 4,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "Storm clouds are dark and gray."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "They are very big and tall."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "Their bottoms are low in the sky, and their tops are high."
          },
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "These clouds make rain!"
          }
        ]
      }
